,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327216735,"data":"# Executed research package\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327250754,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.32725581,"data":"CPU: 21 new classic experts (coherence4, phase7, powers2, CSP4, MiniRocket4),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327259931,"data":"6 saved-prediction variants, 3 frozen-CNN geometry variants, 11 outer folds.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327263711,"data":"New experts are scored alone, with .1/.2 late fusion, and .1/.2 prior fusion\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327267274,"data":"followed by the existing causal transduction. CPU wall cap 240 minutes.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327270954,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327274579,"data":"GPU: four causal latent-alignment Shallow16 models and two TSMNet-derived\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327278178,"data":"models; seeds0,1; 11 outer folds =132 outer fits with inner selection/refit.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327281978,"data":"Inner cell-NLL criterion, max30epochs, patience6. Two-seed means are the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327285292,"data":"primary neural comparison; individual seeds are diagnostics. GPU wall cap\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327289226,"data":"690 minutes; finishes immediately when all work is done.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327293191,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327296622,"data":"Latent alignment uses author-compatible ShallowNet encoder, source-only BN\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327300377,"data":"recalibration frozen during prefix passes, source-shrunk causal context,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327304109,"data":"and our prior SWAD.1 averaging policy. This is a new training recipe;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.32730807,"data":"effects include the BN/prefix policy, not solely an adapter layer.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327311478,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327314876,"data":"TSMNet-derived models retain author4 temporal filters,40 spatial filters,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327318546,"data":"20-dimensional Stiefel BiMap, ReEig, custom spectral backward and LogEig.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327322148,"data":"Normalization is our causal log-Euclidean mean/scalar-dispersion adaptation,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327326546,"data":"prior10, reset per stream, NOT an exact reproduction of author SPDDSMBN.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327330109,"data":"SPD layers and head run in float64 on CPU as in the author implementation;\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327334031,"data":"convolutions run on GPU. RiemannianAdam lr.001, decay.0001; best NLL checkpoint,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327338093,"data":"no averaging of Stiefel parameters. Input band4–36; rawLag4 variant has82rows.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327342307,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327345654,"data":"Source-only feature fitting; current/past target windows only. No validation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.32734906,"data":"data for BN/source statistics, no target labels for adaptation. No future-window\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327366971,"data":"or full-session target statistics. No user attachments are uploaded.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327371337,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327374962,"data":"Historical Lag4/CNN/62.7234% predictions are bundled, not refitted or used as\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327378574,"data":"blocking tolerance controls. Numerical/runtime failures are recorded per job\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327382039,"data":"and independent jobs continue. Atomic prediction receipts prevent the previous\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327386915,"data":"intermediate-summary race. Reports are collected after independent workers end.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327391074,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327394732,"data":"The trainable stacking gate and its new inner source-fold fits are the later\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327398527,"data":"dependent wave D: not claimed as part of this initial fixed-feature/CNN run.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327402344,"data":"SPDIM, extra regularization combinations and personalization remain reserve.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327405489,"data":"No competition submission and no local background poller are started.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.327409456,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":31.328531894,"data":"Actual research starts next. No control fits, no pytest stage, no historical tolerance gate.\n"}
